#!/usr/bin/env python3
# patch-site-14sep-r3.py — knowhere.me website patch, round 3, Mon 14 Sep 2026 (Muppet).
#   parents: outlined secondary links, honest subject count + subjects modal · compare: table wraps on phones, subject count, post-table CTA, modal
#   labels: every remaining "start knowing"/"let's go" → "start your free week"; footer CTAs mirror the page's nav CTA; footer v22
# Run from the knowhere-website repo root:   python3 patch-site-14sep-r3.py        (add --dry to preflight only)
# Idempotent per file (markers). Every anchor asserted before any write. Backups <file>.bak-<ts> (gitignored).
# Any failed receipt restores every file it wrote. Then: git add -A && git commit && git push — commits are yours.
